      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000040.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000040",
          "chapter_order": 40,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "眼前，却是一座秀丽高山。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-2",
      "text": "孙悟空环视四周，天宫、诸神、紫衣服的仙女与假悟空都不在场。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000040.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000040",
          "chapter_order": 40,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "天宫呢，诸神呢"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-3",
      "text": "山中随风送来隐隐歌声，孙悟空虽不懂歌词，却觉得那风从他身体内吹过去，刮走多年艰辛的闷气，先前想与人拼死相斗的念头也随之淡去。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000040.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000040",
          "chapter_order": 40,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "却觉得那风也从他身体内吹过去"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
